# Nawal Yoga Project

## Stack
- Static site: plain HTML, CSS (Tailwind-built `css/style.css`), vanilla JS. No framework or build step.

## Pages
| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `index.html` | Homepage |
| `events.html` | Events hub |
| `retreats.html` | Retreats hub |
| `nawal.html` | Personal landing |
| `workshops/haifa.html` | Haifa Yoga |
| `workshops/al-tira.html` | Al-Tira workshop |
| `workshops/jiva.html` | Redirect → `haifa.html` |
| `events/sound-healing.html` | Sound Healing event |
| `retreats/dahab.html` | Dahab retreat |
| `retreats/zanzibar.html` | Zanzibar retreat |
| `retreats/wadi-rum.html` | Wadi Rum retreat |
| `register/mountain-voice.html` | Mountain Voice form |
| `register/wadi-rum.html` | Wadi Rum form |
| `admin/index.html` | Admin login |
| `admin/dashboard.html` | Admin dashboard |

Root stubs (`retreat-dahab.html`, `Zanzibar.html`, etc.) redirect to the canonical paths above — keep them for old links.

