|--------|----------|
| `brand/` | Logo, avatar |
| `home/` | Hero, moments, trainer, video |
| `haifa/` | Haifa workshop photos |
| `altira/` | Al-Tira cover |
| `events/` | Event photos (sound healing) |
| `dahab/` | Dahab retreat |
| `zanzibar/` | Zanzibar retreat |
| `wadi-rum/` | Wadi Rum retreat |
| `shared/` | Shared CSS/decoration assets |
